{"id": "EUVD-2026-103327", "enisaUuid": "25cb1d28-c79b-3bbf-ab4b-068a34f2cda6", "description": "phpMyFAQ 4.2.0-alpha before 4.2.0-beta lacks effective rate limiting on the unauthenticated user/password/update and user/password/reset endpoints. Unauthenticated attackers can send unlimited reset requests to flood a registered user's inbox with reset emails, exhausting mailer and server resources.", "datePublished": "2026-10-17T18:46:15", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T21:36:11", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/thorsten/phpMyFAQ/security/advisories/GHSA-p2cj-r7vv-fr2r", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/phpmyfaq-4.2.0-alpha-before-4.2.0-beta-missing-rate-limiting-on-password-reset-endpoints"], "aliases": ["GHSA-wmmm-2vwq-3hqq", "CVE-2026-111892"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.26, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "8be13399-bc86-3b6b-a1d1-f9f8261bea41", "product": {"name": "phpMyFAQ", "vendor": {"name": "thorsten"}}, "product_version": "4.2.0-alpha <4.2.0-beta"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "8627a3fb-56a7-3e69-bb98-85435a57d15f", "vendor": {"name": "thorsten"}}], "isExploited": false}